 Field Kit presentation revision 79.\n\nThe exact pull-request preflight/build, merged-source validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, syntax, production reproduction/readiness, deterministic build, immutable freeze, whole-artifact inspection, and seven-attachment evidence assembly passed. The repository's temporary fast-release policy waives the long automated shards; they are explicitly not claimed as passing. Focused controller, Pause, Team focus, and launch contracts passed before merge.\n\nSource PRs: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/487 and https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/500\nSource: `902da32de72d5f2772f11d2a6575f334d56c7cb8`\nTree: `4af42fb9e8bebf1ea1990ce492c82cc97bdffa0e`\nPR gates: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36142759553 and https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36143570723\nQualification and freeze: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36144055589\nArtifact inspection: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36145215545\nEvidence assembly: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36145501198\n\nPublic Pages and hardware acceptance remain separate until completed on the published build.\n"}